  _key: npc.prospector
  _displayName: Dusty
  _description: Sits by the fire at Dry Creek, full of stories about the desert.
  Role: Prospector
  Greetings:
  - Pull up a rock. Fire's warm, the night gets cold out here.
  - Forty years I've panned these creeks. Found one nugget. Lost it.
  - Coyotes sing at night. They're not singing to you.
  Idle: Rattlers lie in the shade. If you hear the rattle, jump back.
  Station: 0
  HasStation: 0
  Activity: 1
  VoicePitch: 0.7
  VoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  Barks:
  - '[think] Gold in them hills... somewhere.'
  - Hot one today.
  - '[whisper] Heard a coyote out by the mesa.'
